* SPICE netlist for the circuit

M1 4 3 0 0 NMOS  * NMOS(M1) with Drain=Node 4, Gate=Node 3, Source=Node 0 (Ground)
M2 2 4 2 2 PMOS  * PMOS(M2) with Drain=Node 2, Gate=Node 4, Source=Node 2

I1 2 3 DC  * Current source I1 between Node 2 and Node 3
Iin 5 0 DC * Current source Iin between Node 5 and Ground

VDD 2 0 DC 5V * Voltage source VDD between Node 2 and Ground

* End of netlist